    "adapt": "Open pasture beside an open barn: the barn is the host and only an anchor. The kit frame is the barn turned to a quarter turn from the world (x east, z north on the farmwest barn b19), the field box (60 x 40 m, centred 59 m from the barn, yaw ignored) stands 50 m east and 25 m south of the barn centre, a wooden fence runs along its west and south sides with a gate opening mid-south, the cart, sacks, hay and implement wrecks stand on the ground beside the opening and the west fence, and a weighbridge (vanilla WeightStation_01 plus an LF_GranaryUnloadAction prompt entity) stands 16 m south of the gate opening, and the farm contract board (LF_HarvestBoard, #3656) and the `harvest` chalkboard stand just outside the fence either side of the gate opening. Rows are rigid: shift, never stretch."
